    "shrimp_note": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "section_id": "listen-to-the-pan",
        "liquid": "<style>\n  .sea-pepper {\n    --ink: #171717;\n    --muted: #5c5c5c;\n    --line: #e5e2dc;\n    --wash: #faf8f4;\n    --gold: #bb8f50;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    background: var(--wash);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 30px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 300px);\n    gap: 34px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: .14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__heading {\n    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.8vw, 30px);\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__lede {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0 0 22px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__rows {\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__row {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 15px 17px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n    gap: 10px 16px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__row--pick {\n    border-color: var(--gold);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__name {\n    grid-column: 1;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__tag {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #fff;\n    background: var(--gold);\n    padding: 3px 8px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__meter {\n    grid-column: 2;\n    grid-row: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 4px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__pip {\n    width: 9px;\n    height: 9px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1.5px solid #d8cfc0;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__pip.is-on {\n    background: #b8462f;\n    border-color: #b8462f;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__note {\n    grid-column: 1 / -1;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__legend {\n    margin: 16px 0 0;\n    padding-top: 14px;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__figure {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__figure img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    display: block;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px -22px rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__cap {\n    margin: 10px 0 0;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 989px) {\n    .sea-pepper {\n      padding: 22px;\n    }\n    .sea-pepper__grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 24px;\n    }\n    .sea-pepper__figure {\n      order: -1;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"sea-pepper\">\n  <div class=\"sea-pepper__grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"sea-pepper__body\">\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__eyebrow\">Listen to the pan</p>\n      <h2 class=\"sea-pepper__heading\">Crisp skin is something you can hear before you can see it.</h2>\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__lede\">\n        Once the fillets go in skin down you cannot see the skin, so the sound is your gauge. Lay them in\n        away from you, press them flat for 30 to 60 seconds, and then listen. Use little to no oil:\n        King Salmon carries enough fat to grease its own pan inside the first minute.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__rows\">\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>Silence in the first ten seconds</span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">Too cold</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Pan heat: 1 out of 5\">\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">The pan was not hot enough and the skin will stick and stew. Lift the fillets out, let the pan come up to heat, and lay them back in.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>A loud, hard sizzle</span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">Too hot</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Pan heat: 5 out of 5\">\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">The skin will scorch before the fat underneath has rendered. Turn the heat down a little and keep going.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row sea-pepper__row--pick\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>A steady, fine crackle</span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">Right here</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Pan heat: 3 out of 5\">\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Fat rendering out from under the skin and frying it from below. Hold it here for 3&ndash;4 minutes skin down, then take the pan off the burner for the rest.</p>\n      </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__legend\">\n        For doneness, lift a corner and look at the side of the fillet: the flesh turns opaque from the\n        bottom up, and that line tells you how far along it is. Finish by thermometer &mdash; pull at\n        130&deg;F in the thickest part and it settles around 135&deg;F on the plate.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <figure class=\"sea-pepper__figure\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/IMG_1447.jpg?width=700\" alt=\"Seared King Salmon fillet with crisp, golden skin, roasted broccoli and snap pea pesto on a stone plate\" width=\"6000\" height=\"4000\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      <figcaption class=\"sea-pepper__cap\">\n        The skin should be crisp and evenly golden all the way across &mdash; that is what pressing it flat buys you.\n      </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 16,
