    "sauce_note": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "section_id": "the-rest",
        "liquid": "<style>\n  .sea-sheet {\n    --ink: #171717;\n    --muted: #5c5c5c;\n    --line: #e5e2dc;\n    --wash: #faf8f4;\n    --gold: #bb8f50;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    background: var(--wash);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 30px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: .14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__heading {\n    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.8vw, 30px);\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n    max-width: 22ch;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__lede {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0 0 24px;\n    max-width: 68ch;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__cols {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 18px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col--pick {\n    border-color: var(--gold);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold);\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__num {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col h3 {\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    margin: 0 0 7px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col p {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__foot {\n    margin: 18px 0 0;\n    padding-top: 14px;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 749px) {\n    .sea-sheet {\n      padding: 22px;\n    }\n    .sea-sheet__cols {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n  }\n\n  .sea-sheet__fig {\n    margin: 22px auto 0;\n    max-width: 360px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__fig img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    display: block;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px -22px rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__figcap {\n    margin: 10px auto 0;\n    max-width: 360px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"sea-sheet\">\n  <p class=\"sea-sheet__eyebrow\">Sear, rest, finish</p>\n  <h2 class=\"sea-sheet__heading\">The four minutes off the heat are what make this work.</h2>\n  <p class=\"sea-sheet__lede\">\n    Skin crisps fast and flesh cooks slowly. Leave a thick fillet skin down until the middle is done and\n    the skin burns; flip it early and the skin goes soft. Splitting the cook in two, with a rest in the\n    middle, lets each part get what it needs.\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"sea-sheet__cols\">\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col sea-sheet__col--pick\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">1</span>\n      <h3>Sear skin down</h3>\n      <p>Medium-high to start, pressed flat for 30 to 60 seconds, then down to medium. Three to four\n      minutes at a steady, fine crackle. The skin does almost all of its crisping here.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">2</span>\n      <h3>Rest, pan off the burner</h3>\n      <p>Lift the fillets onto a rack skin side up for 4 minutes and take the pan off the heat. An empty\n      skillet left on the burner comes back hot enough to burn the skin you just built.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">3</span>\n      <h3>Finish and pull at 130&deg;F</h3>\n      <p>Pan back on medium, fillets back in skin down for 3 more minutes, then flip for 1. Pull at\n      130&deg;F. It carries over to about 135&deg;F on the plate &mdash; wait for 135&deg;F in the pan\n      and it climbs past silky into chalky.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <figure class=\"sea-sheet__fig\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/IMG_1446.jpg?width=760\" alt=\"Crispy skin King Salmon resting on a bed of snap pea pesto beside charred broccoli\" width=\"4000\" height=\"6000\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <figcaption class=\"sea-sheet__figcap\">\n      Plated skin up, on the pesto rather than under it, so the skin stays crisp to the table.\n    </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</div>",
        "padding_top": 24,
        "padding_bottom": 24,
